{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 9, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "variants": [], "id": "仁"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "大人", "id": "大人"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "忠", "id": "忠"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "服", "id": "服"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聽", "id": "聽"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "視", "id": "視"}, {"form": "酒", "id": "酒"}, {"form": "饜", "id": "饜"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.0980179272527715, "source": "酒", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 3.3019907315787074, "source": "酒", "target": "饜"}, {"weight": 2.8965256234705428, "source": "水", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.3856999997045523, "source": "水", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.4910605153623786, "source": "水", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.8965256234705428, "source": "水", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.3856999997045523, "source": "天下", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 1.5102312623506524, "source": "天下", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.203378442910598, "source": "天下", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.0027077474484467, "source": "異", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.2225491898988714, "source": "異", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.321161478566981, "source": "異", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 1.9156963704588168, "source": "異", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.692552819144607, "source": "事", "target": "君"}, {"weight"